"<userinput>cd wpa_supplicant &amp;&amp;\n"
"make BINDIR=/usr/sbin LIBDIR=/usr/lib</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:194
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:198
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:201
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 wpa_{cli,passphrase,supplicant} /usr/sbin/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/docbook/wpa_supplicant.conf.5 /usr/share/man/man5/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/docbook/wpa_{cli,passphrase,supplicant}.8 /usr/share/man/man8/</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 wpa_{cli,passphrase,supplicant} /usr/sbin/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/docbook/wpa_supplicant.conf.5 /usr/share/man/man5/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/docbook/wpa_{cli,passphrase,supplicant}.8 /usr/share/man/man8/</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:206
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install the <application>systemd</application> support files by running the "
"following command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Instale os arquivos de suporte do "
"&quot;<application>systemd</application>&quot; executando o seguinte comando"
" como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:211
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m644 systemd/*.service "
"/usr/lib/systemd/system/</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m644 systemd/*.service "
"/usr/lib/systemd/system/</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:214
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have built <application>WPA Supplicant</application> with "
"<application>D-Bus</application> support, you will need to install "
"<application>D-Bus</application> configuration files. Install them by "
"running the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver construído o &quot;<application>WPA "
"Supplicant</application>&quot; com suporte ao "
"&quot;<application>D-Bus</application>&quot;, [então] você precisará "
"instalar os arquivos de configuração do "
"&quot;<application>D-Bus</application>&quot;. Instale-os executando os "
"seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:221
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m644 dbus/fi.w1.wpa_supplicant1.service \\\n"
"                 /usr/share/dbus-1/system-services/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -d -m755 /etc/dbus-1/system.d &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 dbus/dbus-wpa_supplicant.conf \\\n"
"                 /etc/dbus-1/system.d/wpa_supplicant.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m644 dbus/fi.w1.wpa_supplicant1.service \\\n"
"                /usr/share/dbus-1/system-services/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -d -m755 /etc/dbus-1/system.d &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 dbus/dbus-wpa_supplicant.conf \\\n"
"                 /etc/dbus-1/system.d/wpa_supplicant.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:229
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You will need to restart the system <application>D-Bus</application> daemon "
"before you can use the <application>WPA Supplicant</application> "
"<application>D-Bus</application> interface."
msgstr ""
"Você precisará reiniciar o processo de segundo plano "
"&quot;<application>D-Bus</application>&quot; do sistema antes que possa usar"
" a interface &quot;<application>WPA Supplicant</application>&quot; do "
"&quot;<application>D-Bus</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:241
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring wpa_supplicant"
msgstr "Configurando o wpa_supplicant"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><important><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:245
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are using WPA Supplicant with <xref linkend='NetworkManager'/> (or "
"anything communicating with WPA Supplicant via D-Bus), this section should "
"be skipped.  Running a D-Bus connected WPA Supplicant instance and another "
"WPA supplicant instance configured following this section simultaneously can"
" cause subtle issues."
msgstr ""
"Se você estiver usando o WPA Supplicant com <xref linkend='NetworkManager'/>"
" (ou qualquer coisa que se comunique com o WPA Supplicant via D-Bus), esta "
"seção deveria ser ignorada. Executar-se uma instância de D-Bus conectado a "
"WPA Supplicant e outra instância WPA Supplicant configurada de acordo com "
"esta seção simultaneamente pode causar problemas sutis."

