#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:281
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To connect to an access point that uses a password, you need to put the pre-"
"shared key in <phrase revision=\"sysv\"> <filename> "
"/etc/sysconfig/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf</filename>."
"  </phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\"> <filename> "
"/etc/wpa_supplicant/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf</filename>."
"  </phrase> SSID is the string that the access point/router transmits to "
"identify itself. Run the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para se conectar a um ponto de acesso que usa uma senha, você precisa "
"colocar a chave pré compartilhada em <phrase revision=\"sysv\"> "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/sysconfig/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf</filename>&quot;.</phrase>"
" <phrase revision=\"systemd\"> "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/wpa_supplicant/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf</filename>&quot;.</phrase>"
" &quot;SSID&quot; é a sequência de caracteres que o ponto de acesso/roteador"
" transmite para se identificar. Execute o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:296
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>wpa_passphrase <replaceable>SSID</replaceable> "
"<replaceable>SECRET_PASSWORD</replaceable> &gt; "
"/etc/sysconfig/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>wpa_passphrase <replaceable>SSID</replaceable> "
"<replaceable>SENHA_SECRETA</replaceable> &gt; "
"/etc/sysconfig/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:298
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 /etc/wpa_supplicant &amp;&amp;\n"
"wpa_passphrase <replaceable>SSID</replaceable> <replaceable>SECRET_PASSWORD</replaceable> &gt; /etc/wpa_supplicant/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 /etc/wpa_supplicant &amp;&amp;\n"
"wpa_passphrase <replaceable>SSID</replaceable> <replaceable>SENHA_SECRETA</replaceable> &gt; /etc/wpa_supplicant/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:302
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\"> <filename> "
"/etc/sysconfig/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf "
"</filename> </phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\"> <filename> "
"/etc/wpa_supplicant/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf "
"</filename> </phrase> can hold the details of several access points. When "
"<command>wpa_supplicant</command> is started, it will scan for the SSIDs it "
"can see and choose the appropriate password to connect."
msgstr ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\"> "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/sysconfig/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf"
" </filename>&quot; </phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\"> "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/wpa_supplicant/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf"
" </filename>&quot; </phrase> pode conter os detalhes de vários pontos de "
"acesso. Quando o &quot;<command>wpa_supplicant</command>&quot; for iniciado,"
" ele escaneará os &quot;SSIDs&quot; que conseguir ver e escolherá a senha "
"apropriada para se conectar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:318
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to connect to an access point that isn't password protected, put"
" an entry like this in <phrase revision=\"sysv\"> <filename> "
"/etc/sysconfig/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf</filename>."
"  </phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\"> <filename> "
"/etc/wpa_supplicant/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf</filename>."
"  </phrase> Replace \"Some-SSID\" with the SSID of the access point/router."
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja se conectar a um ponto de acesso que não seja protegido por "
"senha, [então] coloque uma entrada como esta em <phrase revision=\"sysv\"> "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/sysconfig/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf</filename>&quot;."
" </phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\"> "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/wpa_supplicant/wpa_supplicant-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>.conf</filename>&quot;."
" </phrase> Substitua &quot;Algum-SSID&quot; pelo &quot;SSID&quot; do ponto "
"de acesso/roteador."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:331
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"network={\n"
"  ssid=\"<replaceable>Some-SSID</replaceable>\"\n"
"  key_mgmt=NONE\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"network={\n"
"  ssid=\"<replaceable>Algum-SSID</replaceable>\"\n"
"  key_mgmt=NONE\n"
"}"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:337
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Connecting to a new access point that is not in the configuration file can "
"be accomplished manually via the command line, but it must be done via a "
"privileged user. To do that, add the following to the configuration file:"
msgstr ""
"Conectar-se a um novo ponto de acesso que não esteja no arquivo de "
"configuração pode ser realizado manualmente por meio da linha de comando, "
"mas precisa ser feito por meio de um(a) usuário(a) privilegiado(a). Para "
"fazer isso, adicione o seguinte ao arquivo de configuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:343
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"ctrl_interface=DIR=/run/wpa_supplicant GROUP=&lt;privileged group&gt;\n"
"update_config=1"
msgstr ""
"ctrl_interface=DIR=/run/wpa_supplicant GROUP=&lt;grupo privilegiado&gt;\n"
"update_config=1"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:347
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Replace the &lt;privileged group&gt; above with a system group where members"
" have the ability to connect to a wireless access point."
msgstr ""
"Substitua o &lt;grupo privilegiado&gt; acima por um grupo do sistema onde "
"os(as) membros(as) tem a capacidade de se conectarem a um ponto de acesso "
"sem fio."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:352
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are many options that you could use to tweak how you connect to each "
"access point. They are described in some detail in the "
"<filename>wpa_supplicant/wpa_supplicant.conf</filename> file in the source "
"tree."
msgstr ""
"Existem muitas opções que você poderia usar para ajustar como se conecta a "
"cada ponto de acesso. Elas estão descritas com alguns detalhes no arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>wpa_supplicant/wpa_supplicant.conf</filename>&quot; na "
"árvore do fonte."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:361
#, xml-text
msgid "Connecting to an Access Point"
msgstr "Conectando-se a um Ponto de Acesso"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:364
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to configure network interfaces at boot using "
"<command>wpa_supplicant</command>, you need to install the "
"<filename>/lib/services/wpa</filename> script included in <xref "
"linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> package:"
msgstr ""
"Se você quiser configurar interfaces de rede de intercomunicação na "
"inicialização usando o &quot;<command>wpa_supplicant</command>&quot;, "
"[então] você precisa instalar o conjunto de comandos sequenciais "
"&quot;<filename>/lib/services/wpa</filename>&quot; incluído no pacote "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:370
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-service-wpa</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-service-wpa</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:373
#, xml-text
msgid "wpa"
msgstr "wpa"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:377
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If your router/access point uses DHCP to allocate IP addresses, you can "
"install <xref linkend=\"dhcpcd\" role=\"nodep\"/> and use it to "
"automatically obtain network addresses. Create the "
"<filename>/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable> "
"</filename> by running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se o teu roteador/ponto de acesso usar DHCP para alocar endereços IP, você "
"pode instalar o <xref linkend=\"dhcpcd\" role=\"nodep\"/> e usá-lo para "
"automaticamente obter endereços de rede de intercomunicação. Crie o "
"<filename>/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable> "
"</filename> executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:385
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable> &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>ONBOOT=\"yes\"\n"
"IFACE=\"<replaceable>wlan0</replaceable>\"\n"
"SERVICE=\"wpa\"\n"
"\n"
"# Additional arguments to wpa_supplicant\n"
"WPA_ARGS=\"\"\n"
"\n"
"WPA_SERVICE=\"dhcpcd\"\n"
"DHCP_START=\"-b -q <replaceable>&lt;insert appropriate start options here&gt;</replaceable>\"\n"
"DHCP_STOP=\"-k <replaceable>&lt;insert additional stop options here&gt;</replaceable>\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable> &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>ONBOOT=\"yes\"\n"
"IFACE=\"<replaceable>wlan0</replaceable>\"\n"
"SERVICE=\"wpa\"\n"
"\n"
"# Argumentos adicionais para o \"wpa_supplicant\"\n"
"WPA_ARGS=\"\"\n"
"\n"
"WPA_SERVICE=\"dhcpcd\"\n"
"DHCP_START=\"-b -q <replaceable>&lt;insira opções de início apropriadas aqui&gt;</replaceable>\"\n"
"DHCP_STOP=\"-k <replaceable>&lt;insira opções de parada adicionais aqui&gt;</replaceable>\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:399
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you use static addresses on your local network, then "
"create the "
"<filename>/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable> "
"</filename> by running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativamente, se você usar endereços estáticos em tua rede de "
"intercomunicação local, então crie o "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig-<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable> "
"</filename>&quot; executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:406
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable> &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>ONBOOT=\"yes\"\n"
"IFACE=\"<replaceable>wlan0</replaceable>\"\n"
"SERVICE=\"wpa\"\n"
"\n"
"# Additional arguments to wpa_supplicant\n"
"WPA_ARGS=\"\"\n"
"\n"
"WPA_SERVICE=\"ipv4-static\"\n"
"IP=\"192.168.1.1\"\n"
"GATEWAY=\"192.168.1.2\"\n"
"PREFIX=\"24\"\n"
"BROADCAST=\"192.168.1.255\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable> &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>ONBOOT=\"yes\"\n"
"IFACE=\"<replaceable>wlan0</replaceable>\"\n"
"SERVICE=\"wpa\"\n"
"\n"
"# Argumentos adicionais para o \"wpa_supplicant\"\n"
"WPA_ARGS=\"\"\n"
"\n"
"WPA_SERVICE=\"ipv4-static\"\n"
"IP=\"192.168.1.1\"\n"
"GATEWAY=\"192.168.1.2\"\n"
"PREFIX=\"24\"\n"
"BROADCAST=\"192.168.1.255\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:422
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are 3 types of <application>systemd</application> units that were "
"installed:"
msgstr ""
"Existem três tipos de unidades do "
"&quot;<application>systemd</application>&quot; que foram instaladas:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:429
#, xml-text
msgid "wpa_supplicant@.service"
msgstr "wpa_supplicant@.service"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:434
#, xml-text
msgid "wpa_supplicant-nl80211@.service"
msgstr "wpa_supplicant-nl80211@.service"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:439
#, xml-text
msgid "wpa_supplicant-wired@.service"
msgstr "wpa_supplicant-wired@.service"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:445
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The only difference between 3 of them is what driver is used for connecting "
"(-D option). The first one uses the default driver, the second one uses the "
"nl80211 driver and the third one uses the wired driver."
msgstr ""
"A única diferença entre elas três é qual controlador é usado para conectar "
"(opção &quot;-D&quot;). A primeira usa o controlador padrão, a segunda usa o"
" controlador &quot;nl80211&quot; e a terceira usa o controlador com fio."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:452
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can connect to the wireless access point by running the following "
"command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Você consegue se conectar ao ponto de acesso sem fio executando o seguinte "
"comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:457
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ifup <replaceable>wifi0</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ifup <replaceable>wifi0</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:460
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Replace <replaceable>wlan0</replaceable> with the correct wireless interface"
" and <replaceable>wifi0</replaceable> with desired name for the "
"configuration file. Please note that "
"<filename>wpa_supplicant-*.conf</filename> and "
"<filename>ifconfig.*</filename> configuration files need to have identical "
"names, ie both contain <replaceable>wifi0</replaceable> in their name."
msgstr ""
"Substitua &quot;<replaceable>wlan0</replaceable>&quot; pela interface sem "
"fio correta e &quot;<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>&quot; pelo nome "
"desejado para o arquivo de configuração. Por favor, observe que os arquivos "
"de configuração &quot;<filename>wpa_supplicant-*.conf</filename>&quot; e "
"&quot;<filename>ifconfig.*</filename>&quot; precisam ter nomes idênticos, ou"
" seja, ambos conter &quot;<replaceable>wifi0</replaceable>&quot; nos nomes "
"deles."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:469
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>systemctl start "
"wpa_supplicant@<replaceable>wlan0</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>systemctl start "
"wpa_supplicant@<replaceable>wlan0</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:472
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To connect to the wireless access point at boot, simply enable the "
"appropriate <command>wpa_supplicant</command> service by running the "
"following command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Para conectar-se ao ponto de acesso sem fio na inicialização, simplesmente "
"habilite o serviço &quot;<command>wpa_supplicant</command>&quot; apropriado "
"executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:479
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>systemctl enable "
"wpa_supplicant@<replaceable>wlan0</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>systemctl enable "
"wpa_supplicant@<replaceable>wlan0</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:482
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Depending on your setup, you can replace the "
"<filename>wpa_supplicant@.service</filename> with any other listed above."
msgstr ""
"Dependendo da tua configuração, você pode substituir o "
"&quot;<filename>wpa_supplicant@.service</filename>&quot; por qualquer outro "
"listado acima."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/wpa_supplicant.xml:488
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To assign a network address to your wireless interface, consult the <ulink "
"url=\"&lfs-root;/chapter09/network.html\">General Network "
"Configuration</ulink> page in LFS."
msgstr ""
"Para atribuir um endereço de rede de intercomunicação para a tua interface "
"sem fio, consulte a página <ulink url=\"&lfs-"
"root;/chapter09/network.html\">Configuração Geral de Rede de "
"Intercomunicação</ulink> no LFS."

